# Guess the number
set secret to random 1 to 100
set tries to 0
say "I'm thinking of a number from 1 to 100."

while yes:
    ask number "Your guess? " into guess
    add 1 to tries
    if guess is smaller than secret:
        say "Too low!"
    otherwise if guess is bigger than secret:
        say "Too high!"
    otherwise:
        say "You got it in", tries, "tries!"
        stop
